  "rules": "Room tile set: walls face out with outside+ (the room bounds supply outside-; add outside- to the room set's External Sockets), inner faces room. Corridor tile set: open faces path, closed faces x; rock_a / rock_b / rock_c are the empty tiles. Both tile sets use the same MeshLibrary as the GridMap (item = MeshLibrary item). Up / down sockets: leave as the tile set default. Every tile Rotation FourWay (also the symmetric ones: their rotations merge, and a cell you turned by hand is still read as that tile). weight is the tile total; godoowave splits it over the distinct rotations, which gives weight_per_rotation.",
